\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><div><hr></div><h3>Trade alert</h3><ul><li><p>Buy StoneX Group (SNEX). </p></li><li><p>4.0% of the portfolio</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4Jkh!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F926e44d0-b604-4397-87c1-3d775871606d_909x47.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4Jkh!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F926e44d0-b604-4397-87c1-3d775871606d_909x47.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4Jkh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F926e44d0-b604-4397-87c1-3d775871606d_909x47.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4Jkh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F926e44d0-b604-4397-87c1-3d775871606d_909x47.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4Jkh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F926e44d0-b604-4397-87c1-3d775871606d_909x47.png\" width=\"909\" height=\"47\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/926e44d0-b604-4397-87c1-3d775871606d_909x47.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:47,&quot;width&quot;:909,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:6175,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/201471962?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F926e44d0-b604-4397-87c1-3d775871606d_909x47.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4Jkh!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F926e44d0-b604-4397-87c1-3d775871606d_909x47.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4Jkh!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F926e44d0-b604-4397-87c1-3d775871606d_909x47.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4Jkh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F926e44d0-b604-4397-87c1-3d775871606d_909x47.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4Jkh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F926e44d0-b604-4397-87c1-3d775871606d_909x47.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><div><hr></div><p>StoneX is the toll booth on the plumbing of global markets, the middleman that connects farmers, corporates, asset managers and retail traders to exchanges and OTC markets when the big banks won’t serve them. </p><p>It earns spreads, fees, and interest on client cash, and it earns the most when markets are volatile. Q2 FY2026, the quarter ended 31 March, was a record: net operating revenue up 70% to $829M, net income at a record $174M, and a 26.5% return on equity. </p><p>The R.J. O’Brien deal made it the largest non-bank futures broker in the US. And the cash flow against the price is the tell. The business is on a run-rate north of $600M of earnings against a roughly $9B market cap, mostly retained and reinvested at a 20%-plus return.</p><ul><li><p>DCF base case: about $190, roughly 52% above my entry</p></li><li><p>Bear case: about $80</p></li></ul><p>The deep dive is coming out early next week.</p>",
